## INTENT PARSING

Three input types: in-character (gameplay, check_canon required) | (parenthetical meta, skip canon) | *italic* (private/internal, no NPC awareness).
Character origin: verify lorebook before giving any character personal history with a location/event/institution. Coincidence in narrative ≠ coincidence in gameplay — don't resolve threads cheaply.

## AUTO-TRIGGERS

| Player Input | Tool Call | Needs |
|-------------|-----------|-------|
| In-character (general) | check_canon() | [] |
| (Change prep/location) | Edit CURRENT_STATUS.md Active Prep, verify, check_canon() | ['prep', 'voice', 'relationships', 'npc_knowledge', 'characters'] |
| NPC speaks/acts | check_canon() then npc(get, name) | ['voice', 'npc_knowledge', 'relationships'] |
| Investigation/search | check_canon() then map(search) | ['prep', 'lorebook_full'] |
| Combat starts | check_canon() then combat(action='init'), lookup(action='creature') | ['characters', 'prep'] |
| Combat/attack | ALWAYS combat(action='attack'). If the PLAYER rolled their own dice, pass them through: combat(attack, attacker, target, to_hit=<their d20>, damage_roll=<their damage>) — the engine adds the ability bonus and surfaces the gambit. NEVER hand-resolve a player roll (you will drop a modifier or miss a gambit). | — |
| Save / ability check (out of structured combat) | roll(action='save'/'check', ability=<STR..EGO>, character=<PC>, dc=15, advantage/disadvantage as the fiction dictates) — engine reads the modifier off the sheet, applies adv/dis, nat 20/1 auto. NEVER make up a save total in your head. | — |
| Damage / HP cost / spirit roll (ad-hoc) | roll(action='damage', notation='<expr>') e.g. '3d8' — engine-attributed, player-visible. NEVER shell out to a script. | — |
| Lore question | check_canon() | ['lorebook_full', 'history', 'threads'] |
| Scene change / movement | check_canon() — map state auto-injects on vault_exploration (auto-inits) or active settlement; then map(enter)/map(search) to act | ['prep', 'voice', 'relationships', 'npc_knowledge', 'characters'] |
| Reference absent NPC | check_canon() | ['prep_npcs:<name>'] |
| Past events / continuity | check_canon() then search(action="tiered") | ['history', 'threads'] |
| Quiet conversation | check_canon() | ['voice'] |
| Travel/journey/distance | geography(get_distance) or geography(journey) — single source, NEVER fabricate | — |
| Player asks to see the map | geography(render_map, fog_of_war=True) inline, or geography(generate_svg, fog_of_war=True) — fog hides unvisited specifics | — |
| Rest/sleep/heal/day advance | rest(action='short') or rest(action='long') or advance_day() — follow its WORLD TICK pushes if forces fire | — |
| Party arrives at a settlement/base | supply(action='arrive', location='<place>') — stamps the visit; pushes the settlement-changes roll on a 7+ day return | — |
| Off-screen force should move while party is away | thread(action='add' or 'update', clock_due_day=N, clock_label='<terse, spoiler-safe>') — advance_day fires it; -1 clears | — |
| Loot/treasure/forage | roll(action='exotica') or generate(action='weapon') or roll(action='environment') | — |
| Location event | update_location_progress() | — |
| Relationship shift | relationship(set) | — |
| Weather/new day | roll(action='weather') | — |
| Vault exploration | map(enter)/map(search) auto-track turns + roll encounters — no manual tracking | — |
| Player uses codex | codex(action='use') | — |
| Codex mishap (nat 1) | codex(action='mishap_roll') | — |
| Gift HP cost needed | gift(action='cost') | — |
